# Village people and animals through an evening: a village streams in a figure
# a frame, villagers work and watch you pass, gulls leave at dusk, villagers walk
# home and go in, and everyone is back out at dawn.
# Run with: tools/tour.sh tours/characters.tour --seed=1
village 1
wait 1.5
shot 01-village-streamed-in
walk -1,-0.4 1.6
zoom 9
wait 0.5
shot 02-among-them
hour 20.4
wait 7
shot 03-gulls-leave
hour 20.99
wait 1.8
shot 04-walking-home
wait 12
shot 05-indoors
hour 5.5
wait 3
shot 06-dawn
